{"_meta":{"data":{"fbids":[17841400499085780,17841430053940821,17906172015559292,17909972592470586,17911453344524618,17982851181110621,17984065166886252,17984613861116685,17989109448045521,17992732749043745,18013461389954086,18023786693874788,18089152538212247,18090918419385627,18109874675152082,18122574802708752,18125475553883518,18133818358657680,18163412050487967,18164065969422292,18167868580465534,18175698316443680,18217345600355995,18217359952351497,18334197574276706,18394757479162302,18395856865206728],"message_ids":[]},"tool_call_id":"call_01a0dd44c6d97148a1de9ac562c3253e"},"count":25,"format":"social_posts_v1","has_next_page":true,"model_response_guidance":"Above are the raw results. Summarize or synthesize them for the user instead of copying them. Do not reproduce raw content verbatim in any file, HTML, JavaScript, or other web artifact you create from these results. If the user asks you to save or show the results, write a concise summary or extracted facts rather than pasting the source text.","posts":[{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":4,"created_at":"2026-09-15 09:01:02","follower_count":3996,"likes":72,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"OCR skips a whole section of the census form. Gemini reconstructs the main grid but misses everything after question 33. That's 7 missing fields.\n\nCropping recovered them, but I already knew where the error was. For thousands of completed copies, I would use the blank form to build a reusable template and guide the VLM.\n\nComment \"OCR\" and I’ll send you my guides on choosing an OCR model and VLMs for hard documents.","post_id":"17909972592470586","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":1,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdUFwb4AA0r/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_id":"17841400499085780","author_name":"Hamel Husain","comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-15 14:30:59","follower_count":1301,"likes":20,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"An AI draft can get the facts right and still not be good.\n\nIsaac Flath and I tested this on a live session. We had a model turn a blog post into a X post, then read the drafts out loud and talked through each one. \n\nThe ones we liked had a real number in them and one less fact, turns out cutting helped more than adding.","post_id":"18089152538212247","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/358348978_654091696589086_5439248482390941251_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=FnUKRF3jCxwQ7kNvwGSc20h&_nc_oc=Ado5sHaxoL-wVHgpKaeby5Uamd5zUyAtAFdTaXuVRgVZ1vdhFRyPjrqInXMdBgvydLDkqDUKj0uDN4TRofVacZtA&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIdnkcZRLxtps-PvccvfyMLSZeBkNjVLjWTG5BnANBcTw&oe=6ABD653D","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/hamelsmu","rank":2,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdUrhI5AO69/","username":"hamelsmu","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-16 07:01:30","follower_count":3996,"likes":17,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"LandingAI Split takes a parsed PDF and the descriptions of document types that you want. It'll return each document's type, pages, and text, and so intake systems can send it to the right type of extraction.\n\nI tried two sample packets with this, a lease with its attachments and a medical chart from a hospital stay. LandingAI split the lease into all the different documents just as you would expect. The medical chart worked really well except for one page.\n\nThis page is explicitly marked Medical Report Continued, and so I would have expected it to get this split correct. Breaking them up really makes things a lot easier.\n\nComment “PDF” and I’ll send you the course details.","post_id":"17989109448045521","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":3,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdWc4c1mwST/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":3,"created_at":"2026-09-16 09:01:47","follower_count":3996,"likes":37,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"OCR treats this table as empty even though the color gives it the answer. Gray means \"no guidance/not applicable.\"\n\nDocling reads the labels but doesn't record what gray means. Qwen identifies the gray cell and returns it as null, but also returns the category. I would store that category rather than a missing value.\n\nComment \"OCR\" and I’ll send you my guides on choosing an OCR model and VLMs for hard documents.","post_id":"17992732749043745","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":4,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdWqqFjgNxi/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-16 12:00:57","follower_count":3996,"likes":43,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"Datalab has an API that adds readable text and document structure to PDFs for screen readers.\n\nIn the calculus example, there's all kinds of visual information that just pure text doesn't represent. When we look at this text layer, it's very garbled.\n\nIf you use the Datalab API, you can see that the structure is extracted. Formulas get rendered as formulas, and then text can get rendered that way.\n\nI would still have a human in the loop check this. Hopefully it reduces the cost of getting really good accessible ways of reading existing PDF documents.\n\nComment “PDF” and I’ll send you the course details.","post_id":"17906172015559292","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":5,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdW_J0uGQTn/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":4,"created_at":"2026-09-17 07:01:54","follower_count":3996,"likes":20,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"OCR is part of how Finch Legal got its paralegals to handle 5 times the usual caseload.\n\nFinch says that catch-up took about a half hour before they could do the phone call. Now Finch starts working through the paperwork as it arrives. Reducto reads every document and keeps track of where the information came from.\n\nWhen the paralegal needs to look into something deeper, they have a citation that jumps them back to the spot in the actual original document.\n\nIf fact-checking takes as long as it would be to go through it manually, it doesn't save any time.\n\nComment “PDF” and I’ll send you the course details.","post_id":"18164065969422292","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":6,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdZBtd4Dtqk/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-17 09:00:58","follower_count":3996,"likes":11,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"OCR gets this insurance total right, but the numbers inside it don't add up. Docling reads 23 months at $100.83 per month with a $202 total.\n\n2 payments rounds to $202. 23 months definitely doesn't. I could use a heavier model like Chandra, or do the math as a check and build a retry or escalation loop.\n\nComment \"PDF\" and I’ll send you the course details.","post_id":"18217345600355995","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":7,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdZPV2Tkf4K/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":38,"created_at":"2026-09-17 12:01:24","follower_count":3996,"likes":235,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"I've put Jev into my ranking, retrieval, and LLM-as-a-judge workflows.  Video on why it's so useful to me, and why it's better than previous options.  And a blog post on six specific ways I'm using it, with latency and accuracy on my evals, and how it compared to what I had before!\n\nComment JEV and I'll send you the blog post.","post_id":"18395856865206728","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":8,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdZj9SaFFcF/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-23 09:01:02","follower_count":3996,"likes":18,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"Choosing an OCR model is hard when the score doesn't say what really went wrong.\n\nDatalab's OmniExtractBench draws 620 documents from four vendors' benchmarks. Its scorer shows which values matched, were misread, went missing, or were invented.\n\nI tried it on a report: 60 matching values and one missing row label. I then deleted the first row of the casing table. Those values were marked missing, but the next row still matched.\n\nMore document news: https://isaacflath.com/news","post_id":"18175698316443680","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":9,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdosHU2kZIG/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":6,"created_at":"2026-09-24 08:01:02","follower_count":3996,"likes":140,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"MinerU 4.0 gives an agent a way to read a long PDF without loading it into every prompt.\n\nI tested it on a 23-page financing agreement, using the text already stored in the PDF. Each passage got an address containing its document, page, and block number. I used that address to retrieve just the payment clause.\n\nKeyword search with SQLite, then fetch the passage with the answer. All done locally.\n\nMore document news: https://isaacflath.com/news","post_id":"18334197574276706","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":10,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdrKCsgiFve/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":5,"created_at":"2026-09-24 10:01:08","follower_count":3996,"likes":55,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"LiteParse extracts PDF text quickly. LlamaIndex reports about 3 milliseconds per page with OCR off, meaning just the text layer.\n\nI tested it on Berkshire Hathaway's earnings statements. needsOcr was false, and the layout flags said table-likely. Revenue, investment, and expense totals matched across all three years, but the insurance premiums and sales rows merged into one.\n\nYou could route table-likely pages to a table parser, or use table-block bounding boxes to send just the region you need.\n\nMore document news: https://isaacflath.com/news","post_id":"18013461389954086","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":11,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdrXyTziAzA/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-24 12:01:15","follower_count":3996,"likes":23,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"OCR reads the numbers correctly, but merges the model names.\n\nMinerU joins ResNet-50 and ResNeXt-50 into one cell spanning two rows, while keeping their error rates and configurations separate. Importing those rows as written would give both results the same combined name.\n\nOn this page, Docling keeps the names separate: 23.9% stays with ResNet-50, and 23% stays with ResNeXt-50. Each row keeps its configuration.\n\nComment “PDF” and I’ll send you the course details.","post_id":"18090918419385627","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":12,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdrlgC9gCn0/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-25 08:01:15","follower_count":3996,"likes":15,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"I tried Nutrient's chart reading model on a CDC chart with no numbers printed above the bars. It returned 28.8% for one group. The accompanying report says 28.5%.\n\nIt recovered the group and series correctly, but you need to handle the values as estimates.\n\nMore document news: https://isaacflath.com/news","post_id":"18023786693874788","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":13,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Ddtu25HAtco/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-25 10:00:55","follower_count":3996,"likes":17,"media_type":"video","platform":"instagram","post_caption":"Docling added an AFP reader. I tested it on two public sample files: one gave me searchable phrases like \"C++ compiler,\" with some garbled characters. The second was mostly unreadable.\n\nThe reader has an encoding limitation and only extracts text. Even with those limits, it's a useful start.\n\nMore document news: https://isaacflath.com/news","post_id":"18167868580465534","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_u/isaac_flath","rank":14,"source_app":"INSTAGRAM","url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Ddt8j1BjQsv/","username":"isaac_flath","verified":false,"visibility":"public","visibility_verified":true},{"author_bio":"Teaching builders how to extract and use information from documents to make better, faster decisions","author_id":"17841430053940821","author_name":"Isaac Flath","comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-25 10:05:42","follower_count":3996,"likes":0,"media_type":"image","platform":"instagram","post_id":"18109874675152082","profile_picture_url":"https://scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-19/798315741_18114855668001799_567045772025616199_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=f7ccc5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLnd3dy4xMDgwLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=5Q2Dso2Qej8Q7kNvwGGLh9Y&_nc_oc=AdqvIIMpjy1SYeiblmr-98gVctW2u0jcI_zlo7VmwuY9VWMNcoRxHnMdd2V-zZJHh4PLkovxTahaGWLrVdGHrqRh&_nc_zt=24&_nc_ht=scontent-den2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=bma6Hvr-Zs1YgAAnq_V8qA&_nc_ss=7b22e&oh=00_AQIqc_q2RFLzqd_SKPjkvrQ4GZv_brPUPIwbSFCWh1SUsQ&oe=6ABD71C4","profile_url":"https://www.instagra